    "unchanged": "All existing 35 tables retain relative order, metadata/instances and 235 authored cells except PDESC. ResourceTransfer is inserted at index23, matching accepted I03 source placement. RQTY2, ShiftResource QTY2 MAXUT1, 23-25/26-28 shifts, TaskBreakDown DURN1, h28 formation, seed and horizon36 remain fixed.",
